WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.715 --> 00:00:11.957
Very far away from the city lived a farmer and his wife.

2
00:00:12.677 --> 00:00:15.559
There was a narrow dirt road in front of their house.

3
00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:22.602
On the road, there was a big hole filled with water.

4
00:00:25.463 --> 00:00:27.044
The hole was very deep.

5
00:00:27.848 --> 00:00:31.030
Drivers on the road didn't know just how deep.

6
00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:35.511
When they drove into the hole, they could not drive out.

7
00:00:40.134 --> 00:00:44.215
One day, a man in a new car was driving down the road.

8
00:00:44.816 --> 00:00:49.698
He noticed the hole with the water, but he didn't think it was very deep.

9
00:00:49.718 --> 00:00:54.460
He drove into the hole, and his car became stuck.

10
00:00:55.996 --> 00:00:59.599
The man saw the farmer on his tractor, working in the field.

11
00:01:00.479 --> 00:01:02.000
He waved to the farmer.

12
00:01:04.502 --> 00:01:07.484
The farmer drove over to the man in the new car.

13
00:01:07.504 --> 00:01:09.425
"Is there a problem?"

14
00:01:09.906 --> 00:01:10.846
asked the farmer.

15
00:01:10.866 --> 00:01:13.088
"Yes," said the man.

16
00:01:13.108 --> 00:01:15.529
"My car is stuck in this hole.

17
00:01:16.070 --> 00:01:16.890
Can you help me?"

18
00:01:19.132 --> 00:01:23.175
"Maybe," said the farmer, "but I'm very busy."

19
00:01:23.195 --> 00:01:27.437
"If you help me, I'll pay you," said the man.

20
00:01:27.457 --> 00:01:30.519
"Okay," said the farmer.

21
00:01:34.201 --> 00:01:35.622
They agreed on a price.

22
00:01:36.282 --> 00:01:39.624
The farmer towed the car out of the hole with his tractor.

23
00:01:40.725 --> 00:01:43.206
Then the man paid him the money.

24
00:01:44.907 --> 00:01:49.129
The man looked at the farmer and said, "I guess you are rich.

25
00:01:49.649 --> 00:01:52.171
You must tow cars out of this hole day and night."

26
00:01:52.191 --> 00:01:55.565
"Actually, no," said the farmer.

27
00:01:55.585 --> 00:01:58.508
"Why not?"

28
00:01:59.008 --> 00:01:59.809
asked the man.

29
00:01:59.829 --> 00:02:04.813
"The hole is very deep, and a lot of people get stuck and ask for help.

30
00:02:05.414 --> 00:02:07.355
But I don't make money day and night.

31
00:02:07.996 --> 00:02:09.637
I don't pull cars out at night.

32
00:02:10.198 --> 00:02:14.381
At night, I'm busy filling the hole with water," answered the farmer.
